# duo2-os: the WiFi country from the user or the mobile network
# (hotspot/README.md "Regulatory domain"). ath11k takes a user's country
# (iw reg set XX, NL80211_USER_REG_HINT_USER) only with this; without it the
# hint is dropped ("Country Setting is not allowed") and only 11d sets one.
# CERTIFICATION_ONUS itself turns nothing on (its other options default n).
# Folded into duo2.config on 2026-11-12, when 7.3.3-duo2-ge9a21ec26 was promoted;
# kept for older trees.
CONFIG_CFG80211_CERTIFICATION_ONUS=y
CONFIG_ATH_REG_DYNAMIC_USER_REG_HINTS=y
